	(descr "Spring-clamp terminal block, 8 pole, 2.54mm pitch, vertical wire entry. Body (N+1)*2.54 = 22.86 x 12.6 x 13.6mm. Can be built from two 4-pole blocks (4UCON 11380 / SparkFun PRT-08075 / Electrokit 41020663) by removing the 2.54mm end cap from the left-hand one; the F.Fab seam line at x=9.26 marks the joint. Two rows of pins 5.08mm apart; both rows of a pole share one net. Drill 1.2mm per manufacturer PCB layout.")
